    "note": "Respellings applied to the text sent to the speech engine only; captions always show the original words. Hand-written by Claude from the standard English pronunciations of the names; tune any that sound wrong. Keys are lowercase words. Tuned with Whisper on af_heart at speed 1.1: 30 respellings were removed because the plain spelling was transcribed at 0.95 or better and scored higher (squirtle, weedle, nidorina, nidorino, clefairy, clefable, diglett, meowth, psyduck, arcanine, golem, rapidash, magnemite, magneton, doduo, grimer, krabby, exeggcute, cubone, tangela, electabuzz, magikarp, eevee, dratini, dragonite, pewter, cerulean, fuchsia, viridian, lavender). Whisper rewards the spelling rather than the sound, so the rest were kept pending a listen. An empty respelling means the plain spelling was checked and is spoken correctly (the lint treats it as known)."
